  "description": "“CEO, date me.”    \nHer famous boyfriend suddenly breaks up with her! And, to make matters worse, she discovers he had been cheating on her with a famous female idol…    \nFurious, Yujeong decides to take revenge. Her stage for revenge will be Seowon Construction’s anniversary ceremony. But her plan fails, and in front of her ex-boyfriend and his new girlfriend, her pride is about to be shattered… Just then, CEO Jang appears. Yujeong links arms with him and, pretending to be his girlfriend, whispers: “I… came here today because of you, CEO.”\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12255045) \n\n**Official Translations:**    \nR19: [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/173674)    \nR15: [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/174224)",
